s end without an event loop: sends None into"] [252 1 "// it until it returns; a value it yields other than None (a future an event loop would wait on) is a"] [253 1 "// RuntimeError. The value it returns; PY5e's asyncio.run can stand on it for programs that await only"] [254 1 "// coroutines and asyncio.sleep(0)."] [275 2 "// GET_AWAITABLE's oparg: 1 the async with's __aenter__, 2 its __aexit__ (their error's words)"] [291 1 "// opGetAiter is get-aiter: the type's __aiter__(), which must have __anext__."] [313 1 "// opGetAnext is get-anext: the awaitable of the next item, the async iterator kept."] [334 3 "// _PyEval_GetANext: _PyErr_FormatFromCause, the awaitable's error its cause and context"] [346 1 "// opEndAsyncFor is end-async-for ([aiter exc] in the loop's handler): StopAsyncIteration ends the"] [347 1 "// loop, anything else is re-raised."] [357 2 "// a re-raise: the frame's traceback entry made again by the loop at this instruction (as reraise)"] [374 2 "// coroutine"] [382 2 "// coroutine_wrapper"] [408 2 "// async_generator"] [433 2 "// the awaitables of asend and athrow"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[61 34] [177 35] [222 28] [242 28] [317 28] [335 28] [392 66] [417 65] [437 34] [449 58] [459 34] [465 34]]} (go/file "coro.go" :imports [])

